    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connell Properties are delighted to bring to the market 38 Croaghpatrick Road, Navan Road, located in Dublin 7. This is a substantial, extended 4 bedroom semi-detached family home with front garden and driveway, garage to the side and very large sunny south facing back garden and side entrance. A fantastic location only 200 metres to the beautiful Phoenix Park and c.4 Kms to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to c.125 sq. meters and comprises of a wide entrance hall, large living room to the front with stunning bay windows and a downstairs bedroom/home office. A seperate living area with open plan Kitchen/dining to the rear of the house with doors leading to a large back garden. This spacious kitchen/living/dining room is accompanied by a small utility room and bathroom. Upstairs has three bedrooms, the main family bathroom. This property comes to the market presented in good condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThis is a highly desirable mature residential location convenient to numerous City Centre bus routes and walking distance to the local train station and Luas station. The property is convenient to the Phoenix Park and close to shops, schools and transport links. There are also numerous social, sporting and recreational clubs/facilities in the local community and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools.\r\n\r\n\"Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intended purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given\"."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front living room: 4.29m x 3.5m with beautiful feature bay windows\r\n\r\nDining room: 6.3m x 3.5m entered from hallway or through back living room\r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.8m x 2.8m fully fitted kitchen\r\n\r\nUtility room: 2.5m x 1.8m\r\n\r\nBathroom 1: 1m x 2.5m shower, whb and wc\r\n\r\nLiving room: 2.8m X 3.9m opens up into the dining/kitchen area with a feature fireplace\r\n\r\nBedroom/Office: 2.23m X 5.36m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.49m x 3.29m large double bedroom\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.3m x 4.4m large double bedroom\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 2.2m x 2.5m double bedroom\r\n\r\nBathroom 2: 2.25m x 2.1m\r\n\r\nFloor Area: Approx 125 sqm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Substantial family home in mature much sought after location\r\nConsiderable potential to extend further or convert attic\r\nA very large mature back garden\r\nFantastic location close to shops transport links and the wonderful Phoenix Park\r\nExcellent choice of local national and secondary schools\r\nVibrant local community with many sporting and social clubs and activities available"
      },
